    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const params = $('Validate Support Request Payload').item.json.params;\nconst caseInsertResult = $('Create Support Case in Supabase').item.json;\nconst caseId = caseInsertResult.id;\nconst recentCases = $input.all();\nconst isReturning = Array.isArray(recentCases) && recentCases.length > 1;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    case_id: caseId,\n    profile_id: params.profile_id,\n    subject: params.subject,\n    inquiry: params.inquiry,\n    customer_email: params.customer_email,\n    inquirer_type: params.inquirer_type,\n    isReturning\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "b3e44677-6654-499f-bb75-2a2fb9b585a6",
      "name": "Extract Case ID",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        608,
        112
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ ($('Extract Case ID').item.json.isReturning ? 'Note: this person has contacted us within the last 10 minutes -- treat them as a returning visitor in tone, but still answer strictly from retrieved policy documents.\\n\\n' : '') + $json.inquiry }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a professional banking customer support drafting assistant. Use the Policy Knowledge Base tool to find official policy information before answering.\n\nSTRICT RULES:\n(1) Only state policies, fees, wire limits, overdraft rules, or procedures that appear explicitly in retrieved Policy Knowledge Base documents.\n(2) NEVER invent banking rules or hallucinate limits.\n(3) Call the Policy Knowledge Base tool AT MOST TWICE total, with two different phrasings of the question. Do not call it a third time under any circumstances.\n(4) If both searches return no results or nothing relevant, STOP SEARCHING IMMEDIATELY and return your final answer with grounded=false, confidence=0, needs_human=true, and a draft explaining our policy documents don't cover this yet.\n(5) If retrieved policy does not clearly cover the question, set grounded=false, needs_human=true.\n(6) List doc_ids in citations.\n(7) Return ONLY structured JSON: draft (string), grounded (boolean), confidence (number 0-1), citations (array), needs_human (boolean)."
        }
      },
      "id": "a342f61b-67eb-4d07-841f-b2164cd0a2b4",
      "name": "Draft Grounded Reply",
